MaterialReferenceCycleError {
    at    Source/DreamShaderCompiler/Private/Pipeline/DreamShaderPipelineReferences.cpp
    src   "'{0}' is built by '{1}', which reads this pipeline's exported buffer through UE.DreamPassBuffer (directly, or through a pipeline that needs this one), and a pipeline and its pass material that need each other can be built in no order. Inside its own pipeline a pass binds the buffer with 'read' -- a fullscreen material reads it as a UserSceneTexture input -- rather than the exported copy; a mesh pass's material cannot read its own pipeline's buffers."
    text  "'{0}' 由 '{1}' 构建，而后者通过 UE.DreamPassBuffer 读取此管线的导出缓冲（直接读取，或经由一个依赖此管线的管线读取），相互依赖的管线和 Pass 材质无论按什么顺序都无法构建。在自己的管线内，Pass 应当用 'read' 绑定该缓冲——全屏材质会把它作为 UserSceneTexture 输入读取——而不是读取导出的副本；网格 Pass 的材质不能读取自身管线的缓冲。"
    state machine
}

