PassBufferPipelineCycleError {
    at    Source/DreamShaderCompiler/Private/Pipeline/DreamShaderPipelineReferences.cpp
    src   "The pipeline '{0}' needs this material to be built -- it is one of its pass materials, or the material of a pipeline that one needs -- so this material cannot read its exported buffer: the two can be built in no order. Inside its own pipeline a pass binds the buffer with 'read' -- a fullscreen material reads it as a UserSceneTexture input -- rather than the exported copy; a mesh pass's material cannot read its own pipeline's buffers."
    text  "管线 '{0}' 需要先构建此材质——此材质是它的 Pass 材质之一，或是它所依赖的某个管线的材质——因此此材质不能读取它的导出缓冲：两者无论按什么顺序都无法构建。在自己的管线内，Pass 应当用 'read' 绑定该缓冲——全屏材质会把它作为 UserSceneTexture 输入读取——而不是读取导出的副本；网格 Pass 的材质不能读取自身管线的缓冲。"
    state machine
}

